##### Python

::: {#dpi-tiling .cell execution_count=37}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def tiling_rec(n):
    """Recursion on the two states. f(i) tiles a full 2×i; g(i) leaves one cell sticking out."""
    def g(i):
        if i <= 0:
            return 0
        if i == 1:
            return 1
        return g(i - 1) + f(i - 1)

    def f(i):
        if i == 0 or i == 1:
            return 1
        return f(i - 1) + f(i - 2) + 2 * g(i - 2)

    return f(n)
```
:::


