::: {.form-next}
The recursion is the right pair of formulas, and `f(i)` is reached from `f(i+1)`, from `f(i+2)`, and from `g`. Store `mf[i]` and `mg[i]` the first time each length is computed. There are `2(n+1)` states, so the tree collapses to one left-to-right pass. The formulas inside `f` and `g` are unchanged from the previous button.
